        <mxCell id="erd_231" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Money columns (amount, total, arrears, penalties, approval_threshold) are integers in bani: 1 RON = 100 bani.&lt;br&gt;• An administrator manages several associations (associations.administrator_id); the web app sends the selected one with every request.&lt;br&gt;• Residents and the president belong to one association (users.association_id, empty for administrators); one account per apartment.&lt;br&gt;• ballots: one vote per apartment (unique vote_id + apartment_id). apartments: unique association_id + number.&lt;br&gt;• request_logs has no foreign keys, so the history survives when an account is deleted." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1518" width="1500" height="114" as="geometry" />
